  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given,</p><p>Current in the arc&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>i</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math></p><p>Current in the arc&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>i</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math></p><p>Radius of arc&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>cm</mi></math></p><p>Radius of arc&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>cm</mi></math></p><p>Magnetic field at the centre of circular current carrying arc is given by</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>B</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>&#956;</mi><mn mathvariant=\"italic\">0</mn></msub><mi>i</mi></mrow><mrow><mn mathvariant=\"italic\">4</mn><mi>&#960;</mi><mi>R</mi></mrow></mfrac><mfenced><mi>&#952;</mi></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo></math>&nbsp;</p><p>Where,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#952;</mi></math>&nbsp;is the&nbsp;angle subtended&nbsp;at centre.</p><p>Magnetic field at the centre due to arc <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi></math>&nbsp;is given by&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mi>A</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#956;</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><msub><mi>&#960;R</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mi>B</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#956;</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><msub><mi>&#960;R</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>3</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>Dividing equation (2) by (1), we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>B</mi><mi>A</mi></msub><msub><mi>B</mi><mi>B</mi></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>i</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>i</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mn mathvariant=\"italic\">2</mn></msub><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mn mathvariant=\"italic\">1</mn></msub><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>B</mi><mi>A</mi></msub><msub><mi>B</mi><mi>B</mi></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mrow><mn>5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>B</mi><mi>A</mi></msub><msub><mi>B</mi><mi>B</mi></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>6</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac></math></p>",
